{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 18, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "variants": [], "id": "仁"}, {"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "尊", "id": "尊"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "惻", "id": "惻"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "矢", "id": "矢"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖", "id": "聖"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}, {"form": "隱", "id": "隱"}, {"form": "霸", "id": "霸"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "禮", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.3513752571634776, "source": "禮", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 0.7419373447293773, "source": "禮", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.449987545831587, "source": "禮", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 2.533696813957432, "source": "禮", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "天", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "天", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 0.5877866649021191, "source": "人", "target": "聖"}, {"weight": 0.9242589015233319, "source": "人", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 1.1474024528375417, "source": "人", "target": "力"}, {"weight": 0.04879016416943205, "source": "人", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 0.3364722366212129, "source": "人", "target": "政"}, {"weight"